                <head>Appendix 165</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Extracts From the Minutes of 21st
                        Meeting of the Communications Section Held May 21 Regarding Despatch of
                        Railway Material to Poland Via Dantzig</hi></p>
                <p>3<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. It was decided that the Communications Section
                    should request the S. E. C. to insist that the Germans should allow railway
                    material and commercial shipments to pass through Dantzig to Poland.</p>
            </div>
